  "content": "\n\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ftnt-barrels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/bf84aa11b4afd69cdbd20a199bc6d93c50fac58b.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/tnt-barrels/settings/https:/curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/tnt-barrels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3531508338997863e0b15c2252d16bf51ceb5669.png\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252ftnt-barrels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/eac8caa46edda35d821be9a2e1a8e16a00a9cadc.png\" alt=\"Planet Minecraft\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>TNT Barrels</strong>&nbsp;是一款資源包，將 TNT 替換為裝滿火藥的木桶。它也會將「TNT 礦車」的物品圖示更換為與 TNT 保持一致的樣式。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/K9iuJt0Z/images/9c08ad8504ba65caeff97ceb8cdcd22aa0c1680e.png\" alt=\"裝有 TNT 木桶的礦坑\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>",
